  {
    question: 'How do I get LLumar window film installed in Philadelphia?',
    answer: 'Contact us for a free site assessment. We evaluate your glass, orientation, and goals, then recommend the appropriate LLumar series for each area of your building. We provide written specifications and a proposal before any work begins.',
