    <div class="ll-hero__shade"></div>
    <div class="ll-hero__content">
      <p class="ll-hero__eyebrow"><span>LLumar Window Film</span><span>Philadelphia, PA</span><span>Authorized Installer</span></p>
      <h1 class="ll-hero__title">LLumar Window Film for Philadelphia</h1>
      <p class="ll-hero__animated">
        <FlipWords
          words={['for offices and commercial buildings', 'for rowhomes and residences', 'for retail storefronts', 'for hotels and hospitality']}
          class="ll-hero__flip"
        />
      </p>
      <p class="ll-hero__subtitle">LLumar is an Eastman Performance Films brand trusted by architects, facilities managers, and property owners across Philadelphia. Sun control, insulation, safety, and privacy film — the full commercial lineup, professionally installed with manufacturer warranty.</p>
      <div class="ll-hero__cta">
        <a href="/contact/" class="ll-btn ll-btn--primary">Get Your Free Estimate</a>
        <a href="tel:2673947980" class="ll-btn ll-btn--secondary">Call (267) 394-7980</a>
      </div>
