          <p>Window Film Philadelphia is an authorized LLumar dealer serving Philadelphia, Main Line, South Jersey, and the surrounding suburbs. Every installation includes a manufacturer-backed warranty — not just a contractor guarantee — and our team specs, installs, and documents LLumar film to Eastman's published standards.</p>
          <div class="ll-creds" aria-label="LLumar installer credentials">
            <span>LLumar Authorized Installer</span>
            <span>Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
            <span>Serving Philadelphia Since 2008</span>
            <span>Manufacturer-Backed Warranty</span>
          </div>
        </div>
