    </section>

    <section class="ll-trust" aria-label="LLumar trust credentials">
      <div class="ll-wrap">
        <p>Philadelphia's authorized LLumar installer — stocking the full commercial film lineup</p>
        <div class="ll-trust__badges">
          <span>LLumar Authorized Installer</span>
          <span>Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span>Manufacturer-Backed Warranty</span>
          <span>Serving Philadelphia Since 2008</span>
