    <section class="ll-products">
      <div class="ll-wrap">
        <div class="ll-section-head">
          <p class="ll-kicker">Product Lines</p>
          <h2>The LLumar lineup for Philadelphia glass</h2>
          <p>LLumar window film Philadelphia specifications can be matched to solar control, year-round insulation, glass security, and daytime privacy goals.</p>
