            <span>ATC Series</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ll-product__copy">
            <p class="ll-kicker">LLumar ATC Solar Control Window Film</p>
            <h3>ATC Series — Non-Metallic Solar Control for Philadelphia Offices</h3>
            <p>The ATC Series is LLumar's flagship architectural solar control film — a non-metallized spectrally selective product that rejects up to 74% of solar energy and 99% of UV radiation while maintaining high visible light transmission. Because the film contains no metal, it does not interfere with Wi-Fi, cellular, or building access signals — a practical advantage in Philadelphia's dense commercial core. The neutral exterior appearance reads as clear glass from the street, meeting most Center City building management aesthetic requirements.</p>
            <p>For Philadelphia's south- and west-facing offices — the windows that drive cooling loads from May through September — the ATC Series is available in VLT options from 20% to 70%. A lifecycle analysis found LLumar ATC film typically becomes carbon-negative within six months of installation on a commercial building due to HVAC energy savings.</p>
            <div class="ll-specs"><span><strong>74%</strong> Solar Rejection</span><span><strong>99%</strong> UV Block</span><span><strong>70%</strong> Max VLT</span><span><strong>15yr</strong> Commercial Warranty</span></div>
            <div class="ll-pdfs">
              <a href="/resources/llumar-window-film-solar-control-performance-specs-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LLumar Solar Control Performance Data</a>
              <a href="/resources/llumar-window-film-atc-architectural-solar-control-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ATC Architectural Spec Sheet</a>
            </div>
            <p class="ll-note">Commercial: 15 years. Residential: lifetime limited. Source: LLumar.com</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="ll-product ll-product--reverse">
          <div class="ll-product__media">
            <img src="/images/llumar-low-e-insulating-window-film-philadelphia.jpg" alt="LLumar Low-E insulating window film Philadelphia rowhome glass" title="LLumar Low-E insulating window film Philadelphia" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy" />
            <span>Low-E Series</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ll-product__copy">
            <p class="ll-kicker">LLumar Low-E Climate Control Window Film</p>
            <h3>Low-E Series — Year-Round Insulation for Philadelphia's Four Seasons</h3>
            <p>Most solar control films are summer products. LLumar Low-E is different — it's a dual-season low-emissivity film engineered to work in both directions. In summer, it rejects solar heat gain. In winter, it reflects interior warmth back into the room. The result is a window that performs closer to double-pane insulated glass without the cost or disruption of replacement — meaningful for Philadelphia's large stock of aging single-pane rowhome glass.</p>
            <p>LLumar Low-E maintains high visible light transmission and reads as clear glass from inside and out. With just 15% exterior reflectance, it stays within the guidelines of Philadelphia's historic neighborhood HOAs and commission review requirements in Germantown, Chestnut Hill, and Society Hill.</p>
            <div class="ll-specs"><span><strong>74%</strong> VLT (near-clear)</span><span><strong>~35%</strong> U-value Improvement</span><span><strong>~30%</strong> SHGC Improvement</span><span><strong>Lifetime</strong> Res. Warranty</span></div>
            <div class="ll-pdfs">
              <a href="/resources/llumar-window-film-low-e-energy-saving-residential-philadelphia.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Low-E Energy Saving Spec</a>
            </div>
            <p class="ll-note">Residential limited lifetime warranty. Commercial: 15 years. U-value improvement on single-pane clear glass. Source: LLumar.com</p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="ll-product">
          <div class="ll-product__media">
            <img src="/images/llumar-safety-security-window-film-philadelphia.jpg" alt="LLumar safety security window film Philadelphia storefront glass" title="LLumar safety and security window film Philadelphia" width="720" height="900" loading="lazy" />
            <span>Safety Series</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ll-product__copy">
